      exA: { ok: "Students who travel an hour across a congested city to reach a half-past-seven assembly.", d: ["Students who routinely stay up past midnight to finish the assignments set for the following morning.", "Boarding schools that switch off the lights in dormitories at ten.", "The alarm-clock apps that most teenagers now rely on."] },
