      mechA: { ok: "channelling students into popular courses on the basis of prestige rather than of the vacancies that exist", d: ["expanding the number of university places far faster than the economy is able to create graduate jobs for them", "producing a surplus of business and law graduates beside unfilled posts in engineering and nursing", "automating the entry-level positions that graduates once filled"] },
